                            <comment id="14746868" author="githubbot" created="Wed, 16 Sep 2015 05:04:48 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;GitHub user minahlee opened a pull request:&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;    &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/apache/incubator-zeppelin/pull/309&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;https://github.com/apache/incubator-zeppelin/pull/309&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;    &lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/ZEPPELIN-309&quot; title=&quot;Redirect to created/cloned notebook page on notebook creation/clone&quot; class=&quot;issue-link&quot; data-issue-key=&quot;ZEPPELIN-309&quot;&gt;&lt;del&gt;ZEPPELIN-309&lt;/del&gt;&lt;/a&gt; Redirect to created/cloned notebook page on notebook c&#8230;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;    &#8230;reation/clone&lt;/p&gt;

